! lobsterin for diamond, matched to Diamond/wannier90.win
! Wannier projections:  C:s,p   (8 functions per cell)
! Wannier outer window: -19 to 30 eV absolute, E_F = 10.05 eV (OUTCAR)
!   -> -29.05 to 19.95 eV relative to E_F (LOBSTER energies are relative to E_F)
!   All four valence bands lie inside the window, as before.
basisSet pbeVaspFit2015
basisfunctions C 2s 2p
COHPstartEnergy -29.05
COHPendEnergy 19.95
cohpGenerator from 1.4 to 20
